### 3. Local Git Commands to Push Code (If starting from local terminal)

Agar aapne repository GitHub par bana li hai aur local project ko wahan link aur push karna chahte hain, toh apne terminal (`C:\Users\Abullah\Desktop\project`) mein yeh commands run karein:

```bash
git init
git add .
git commit -m "Initial commit: VirgoFash v0.2.0 release"
git branch -M main
git remote add origin https://github.com/abdullahjahangirai/virgofash.git
git push -u origin main
